ist path is the proper path to the data.\n\nMy final step is to validate the JSON itself. It's a valid JSON structure, I can confirm. Furthermore, I have reviewed the schema, and the payload matches (a2ui-json, createSurface, surfaceId: \"main\", components, dataModel), so the schema appears to be correct.\n\nBased on all of this, I'm satisfied. It meets all the criteria, every aspect. I'm going to mark this as a \"C\" (correct).\n\n\n",
